  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fight Against Gender Based Violence and Femicides in the Western Balkans</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This projects supports gender equality and tackling Gender Based Violence across the Western Balkans through analysis of handling of cases of femicides; review of caselaw in cases of Gender Based Violence; targeted training for judiciary and other institutions within the justice system on applying international best practice; and annual review of practice by the European Court of Human Rights.</narrative>
  </description>
